随时平包兑车，为其巡河包的目的。","text":"黑方进包巡河可以随时平包兑车，为其巡河包的目的。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":6,"anchor_node_id":"0:6","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment7:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment7","raw_text":"红方兵七进一避免黑方的包八平三。","text":"红方兵七进一避免黑方的包八平三。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":7,"anchor_node_id":"0:7","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment8:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment8","raw_text":"黑方布成屏风马。","text":"黑方布成屏风马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":8,"anchor_node_id":"0:8","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment9:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment9","raw_text":"红方跳出正马。","text":"红方跳出正马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":9,"anchor_node_id":"0:9","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment10:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment10","raw_text":"黑方飞象。","text":"黑方飞象。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":10,"anchor_node_id":"0:10","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment11:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment11","raw_text":"红方跃马盘河，次一著红方可以马六进四踩黑方的七路马。","text":"红方跃马盘河，次一著红方可以马六进四踩黑方的七路马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":11,"anchor_node_id":"0:11","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment12","raw_text":"黑方卒七进一解消红方的马六进四。","text":"黑方卒七进一解消红方的马六进四。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"0:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment13:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment13","raw_text":"红方架五七炮威胁黑方的三路马。","text":"红方架五七炮威胁黑方的三路马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"0:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment15:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment15","raw_text":"黑方支士，红方明车抓包。","text":"黑方支士，红方明车抓包。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":15,"anchor_node_id":"0:15","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment16:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment16","raw_text":"黑方只好平车保包。","text":"黑方只好平车保包。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":16,"anchor_node_id":"0:16","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment17","raw_text":"红方进马去卒，攻击顺利。","text":"红方进马去卒，攻击顺利。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"0:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment18","raw_text":"如果这个时候黑方平包兑车。","text":"如果这个时候黑方平包兑车。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"0:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment19","raw_text":"红方接受兑车。","text":"红方接受兑车。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"0:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment21","raw_text":"兑车之後，轮由红方下。红方车二进一，很快速的将右侧的车移到左侧来，因为左侧黑方防守薄弱。","text":"兑车之後，轮由红方下。红方车二进一，很快速的将右侧的车移到左侧来，因为左侧黑方防守薄弱。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"0:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment22","raw_text":"黑方进包去兵。","text":"黑方进包去兵。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"0:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment23","raw_text":"红方平车抓马当然。","text":"红方平车抓马当然。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"0:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment24","raw_text":"黑方马二进三为最强的抵抗。","text":"黑方马二进三为最强的抵抗。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"0:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment25","raw_text":"红方进马去象可以多得一子。","text":"红方进马去象可以多得一子。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"0:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment27:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment27","raw_text":"多得一苹相之後，局面红方优势。","text":"多得一苹相之後，局面红方优势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":27,"anchor_node_id":"0:27","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_18","raw_text":"我们再退回来看，当这个局面，红方马六进七，很明显红方次一著要马七进五去象、去马多得一子。黑方包二进四，有没有防止到红方多得一子呢？","text":"我们再退回来看，当这个局面，红方马六进七，很明显红方次一著要马七进五去象、去马多得一子。黑方包二进四，有没有防止到红方多得一子呢？","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"1:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_19","raw_text":"红方进马去象当然。","text":"红方进马去象当然。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"1:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_20","raw_text":"黑方还是没有防止到红方多得一子，不过黑方是以攻代守。","text":"黑方还是没有防止到红方多得一子，不过黑方是以攻代守。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"1:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_22","raw_text":"黑方跃马盘河弃中卒於不顾。","text":"黑方跃马盘河弃中卒於不顾。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"1:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_23","raw_text":"红方进车巡河，次一著进兵兑卒。","text":"红方进车巡河，次一著进兵兑卒。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"1:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_24","raw_text":"黑方只好进马去兵。","text":"黑方只好进马去兵。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"1:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_25","raw_text":"很多棋友这个时候会进包去中卒。","text":"很多棋友这个时候会进包去中卒。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"1:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_26:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_26","raw_text":"黑方可以进车抓炮，这样红方这一苹当头炮还是站不稳。","text":"黑方可以进车抓炮，这样红方这一苹当头炮还是站不稳。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"1:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_25","raw_text":"所以这一步棋不能进包去中卒。红方进七路兵的目的是引诱黑方飞象去兵。黑方如果飞象去兵，红方进炮去中卒，就有叫将的棋了。","text":"所以这一步棋不能进包去中卒。红方进七路兵的目的是引诱黑方飞象去兵。黑方如果飞象去兵，红方进炮去中卒，就有叫将的棋了。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"2:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_26:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_26","raw_text":"所以黑方先进马去炮。","text":"所以黑方先进马去炮。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"2:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_28","raw_text":"再飞象去兵。","text":"再飞象去兵。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"2:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_29","raw_text":"红方跃马盘河是舒服的先手利，因为这一步棋有踩包踩中卒的棋。","text":"红方跃马盘河是舒服的先手利，因为这一步棋有踩包踩中卒的棋。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"2:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_31:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_31","raw_text":"黑方退包时，红方马踩中卒。红方这一苹五路马威风八面，黑方的二路车包被红方的八路车牵制，黑方的八路车包又被红方的二路车牵制，局面到此黑方不利了。","text":"黑方退包时，红方马踩中卒。红方这一苹五路马威风八面，黑方的二路车包被红方的八路车牵制，黑方的八路车包又被红方的二路车牵制，局面到此黑方不利了。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":31,"anchor_node_id":"2:31","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_32","raw_text":"黑方退象到中路。","text":"黑方退象到中路。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"2:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_33","raw_text":"红方退炮抢包。","text":"红方退炮抢包。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"2:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_35:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_35","raw_text":"红方进马踩车。","text":"红方进马踩车。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":35,"anchor_node_id":"2:35","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_36:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_36","raw_text":"黑方只好车八进一。","text":"黑方只好车八进一。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":36,"anchor_node_id":"2:36","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_37","raw_text":"红方平炮到中路，局面到此红方占绝对的优势。||||这盘棋我们学到五七炮配合盘河马，在这个局面红方有进马去象多得一子的棋，所以黑方的局面一直打不开。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！||","text":"红方平炮到中路，局面到此红方占绝对的优势。\n\n这盘棋我们学到五七炮配合盘河马，在这个局面红方有进马去象多得一子的棋，所以黑方的局面一直打不开。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！\n","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":37,"anchor_node_id":"2:37","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["6.当头炮进七兵未进车左马盘河攻屏风马左炮巡河局"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第5节 进七兵攻击篇 第二章"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":45,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":3,"structured_branches":2,"line_statuses":{"legal":3},"source_move_records":49,"legal_move_records":49,"annotations":38,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":38}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-65","category_id":"65","title":"第二章 当头炮攻屏风马 第5节 进七兵攻击篇 6.当头炮进七兵未进车左马盘河攻屏风马左炮巡河局","catalogue_order":64,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-65-3.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-65"]}}
